1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,700
Welcome! Here is a quick workflow showing how the league works, from sign-up to earning points.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,700
Step one: enter your first name and last initial for the league board.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,700
Step two: enter your email address. There is no password: we email you a sign-in link.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,700
Step three: read the privacy note and tick the box. Only facilitators can see your email.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,700
Step four: choose whether you are joining as a learner or a volunteer.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:31,700
Step five: pick the team you would like to join, then tap Complete Registration.

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,700
Finally, open the sign-in link we email you. A facilitator will approve your registration, and then you can start.

8
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:48,700
Every weekday, a short challenge appears, about five to fifteen minutes. Answer by typing, recording a voice note, or uploading a photo.

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:54,700
Your facilitator reviews your effort and awards points. Every submission earns points for your team!

10
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:03,700
You can also claim ten bonus points each week by attending in person at the Connect Talent centre, confirmed by your facilitator.

11
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:11,700
Check the leaderboard anytime to see where you stand. You can track your team ranking and follow individual learner scores.

12
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,700
That is the whole workflow! Have fun and enjoy learning!
